eaching, live streaming, and content creation. Capture every detail with vivid colors and crisp visuals","Built-In Noise - Our webcam is equipped with an advanced noise-canceling microphone that ensures your voice is transmitted clearly even in noisy environments. This feature makes it perfect for webinars, conferences, live streaming, and professional video calls—your voice remains crisp and clear regardless of background noise or distractions","Automatic Light Correction Technology - This cutting-edge technology dynamically adjusts video brightness and color to suit any lighting condition, ensuring optimal visual quality so you always look your best during video sessions—whether in extremely low light, dim rooms, or overly bright settings. It enhances clarity and detail in every environment","Easy Plug and Play - Our easy-to-operate HD webcam works with USB 2.0, USB 3.0 and USB 3.1 and doesn't require you to download additional drivers and it comes equipped with a 5ft USB power cable. Just plug the webcam into the USB port of your devices and use it right away!","Secure Privacy Cover Protection - The included privacy shield allows you to easily slide the cover over the lens when the webcam is not in use, offering immediate privacy and peace of mind during periods of non-use. Safeguard your personal space and prevent unauthorized access with this simple yet effective solution, ensuring your security at all times","Wide Compatibility and Versatility - The Gowzmnd HD Webcam can be used with desktop PCs, laptops, tablets, Android phones, and other UVC protocol devices. It is compatible with multiple operating systems, including Windows XP/7/8/10/11, Mac iOS, Vista, Linux 2.6 or later.","Detachable Tripod - Easily set up your web cam with the flexible tripod or use the built-in clip to attach the webcam directly to your devices."],"review_summary":"; ; Brand Gowzmnd Photo Sensor Technology CMOS Video Capture Resolution 1080p Maximum Focal Length 4 millimeters Flash Memory Type SD Video Capture Format AVI Screen Size 2.7 inches Connectivity Technology USB Color black Special Feature Low Light See more","pros":["Great value for money","Reliable build quality","Strong overall performance"],"cons":["May not suit every preference","Check our full review for trade-offs"],"root_gallery":"{https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NOLwhrplL.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4107b1G2jcL.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41fb0prjgGL.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41tNoRwdm5L.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41hMUT2-F0L.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/419HeFUz03L.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41GUAhPqTnL.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pe95F664L.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sxI+4PZlL.png,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31hOpzUe+hL.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41CBtE961yL.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41zTvd1m-AL.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41r3-ALj4JL.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41E50-NRCkL.jpg}"}